flowchart TD
    START[Router.Forward] --> LIST[ListGateways from Redis]
    LIST --> ENRICH[enrichCircuit per gateway]
    ENRICH --> SCORE[ComputeScore + RankScores]
    SCORE --> PICK[PickPrimary weighted random]
    PICK --> ORDER[FailoverOrder by score desc]

    ORDER --> LOOP{For each candidate}
    LOOP --> SEL{Selectable?}
    SEL -->|no: disabled/open/unknown/low health| LOOP
    SEL -->|yes| ALLOW[circuitbreaker.Allow gateway_id]
    ALLOW -->|rejected| LOOP
    ALLOW -->|allowed| FWD[HTTP forward to gateway URL]
    FWD --> OUT{Success?}
    OUT -->|yes| REC[RecordOutcome + breaker.Record success]
    OUT -->|no/timeout| RECF[RecordOutcome failure]
    RECF --> LOOP
    REC --> DONE[Return to client]
    LOOP -->|exhausted tries| FAIL[503 all gateways unavailable]
